DESCRIPTION:After almost 30 years of selling out rooms all over the country
  and now the world\, Earthquake born Nathaniel Stroman has mastered his cra
 fts as a beloved comedian\, actor\, voice artist and radio personality. He'
 s exceeded his own expectations as he continues to thrive in the comedy are
 na\, and as he still basks in the success of his critically acclaimed comed
 y special Chappelles Home Team - Earthquake: Legendary for Netflix lauded b
 y the New York Times as the funniest comedy special of that year.\n\nIt was
  2021 when Earthquake taped his famed comedy special for Netflix entitled C
 HAPPELLE'S HOME TEAM: EARTHQUAKE LEGENDARY to rave reviews. The world of co
 medy shook as people were reintroduced to 'Quake' on a global platform and 
 some audiences were introduced to him for the very first time. Named 'Comed
 y Special of the Year' by the New York Times\, Earthquake celebrated the op
 portunity to connect with audiences in ways he's never done before.\n\nWhil
 e his fanbase has followed him from his early days on BET and HBO's Def Com
 edy Jam\, Quake continues to sellout rooms all over the country on the club
  circuit and concert venues.\n\nPresently\, Earthquake is enjoying recurrin
 g roles on Cedric the Entertainers' The Neighborhood (CBS)\, Johnson (Bounc
 e) and South Side (HBO MAX). He can also be seen on Winning Time: The Rise 
 of the Lakers Dynasty (HBO MAX). Earthquake has also enjoyed being featured
  in several episodes of the new hit game show Celebrity Squares for VH-1 an
 d is prominently featured in the new Jerry Seinfeld film for Netflix\, enti
 tled Unfrosted.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/eart
 hquake-23389/
